==Trivia==
[[File:DondozoShiningRevelry20 combined artwork.png|thumb|300px|Combined illustration]]
This card's standard illustration forms a {{TCG|combined illustration}} with {{TCG ID|Shining Revelry|Dondozo|20}} from the same expansion.

===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration features {{p|Tatsugiri}} in its {{form|Tatsugiri|Curly Form}}. The illustration rare print also features its Droopy and Stretchy Forms, along with several {{p|Dondozo}}.
*'''Rain Splash''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Deoxys|Lotad|63}} from the {{TCG|EX Deoxys}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

